  "schema_version": 1,
  "note": "EXEC-SCREENER-FLOW-CANDLES P5 (verification/screener/P5_FLOW.md section 2): the output kind of every output of the Terminal's 48 flow indicators (flowRegistry.json), from EXEC.md \"Cakupan flow\" (K continuous normalised, P percentile or z-score, Rp rupiah or another amount, L lots per transaction, H price level, D day count, F 0/1 signal, B broker count) and OPERATORS.md section 4, and the ADV liquidity floor flag (EXEC.md: FL03-FL06, FL08, FL10, FL13-FL15, FL36, FL46). The operators block of screener-metrics.json reads the kinds (measures and tests not offered on a kind: rank and percentile-type measures not on H, = and != only on D, F and B, K7). An output is a kind letter, {\"kind\", \"unit\"} (a unit other than the registry's), or {\"by\": <parameter>, <option>: ...} when the kind follows a parameter. requires: data the Screener does not hold (insider). The screener registry generator (scripts/build-screener-registry.mjs) refuses an indicator or output without a row.",
  "window_sessions": 60,
  "window_note": "K1 (user 2026-11-07): the broker window the publisher writes (P4 BROKER_DAY_SESSIONS = 60); the window a built-in baseline left out is capped to when the caller names no loaded window (the worker always names its own).",
